  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「やっほ。放課後だね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「わたしは部活に行くけど、転校生くんはどうするの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いつもなら、生徒会に顔をだすんだろうけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『帰宅部争奪戦』ってのに対して、どういう態度をとるのか決めてからのほうがいいよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「また、あの生徒会長に振り回されて終わっちゃうかもだし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「なぁんて、おおきなお世話かな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「……あれ？　何見てるの、それ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うわっ、大量のチラシが机のなかに入ってる！　ぜんぶ、部活への勧誘？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「同じようなメールもたくさん届いてるの？　何でみんな君のメアドを知ってるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うわぁ、予想はしてたけど。やっぱり、こういう事態になっちゃったかぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「早いとこ、どこに入部するか決めるか……。『どこにも入部しない！』って態度を示さないと、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「こんなのが毎日つづいちゃうよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「とりあえず、体験入部だけでもしてみれば？　それで、義理は立つし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「何かやりたいことが見つかったら、そこに正式に入部してもいいんだしね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「興味があったら、うちの美術部にもきてね。それじゃあ、がんばって♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
